     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Moods and the verb «zijn» (to be)",
     "texto": [
      "The key question to greet someone and ask how they are is «Hoe gaat het?» (How's it going? / How are you?). To answer: «Goed» (good / fine), «Prima» (great), or to say how you feel with the verb «zijn» (to be): «Ik ben moe» (I am tired), «Ik ben blij» (I am happy), «Ik ben druk» (I am busy / I have a lot going on)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
